<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ReachScope 报告 — {{ report.meta.package or "(unknown package)" }}</title>
<style>
:root {
  --accent: #b3261e;
  --ink: #1a1a1a;
  --muted: #5a5a5a;
  --line: #d0d0d0;
  --soft: #f4f4f4;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { font-size: 16px; }
body {
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  max-width: 68rem;
  background: #fff;
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans CJK SC",
    "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.65;
}
h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.3; }
h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; margin: 0 0 0.4rem; }
h2 {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  margin: 2.6rem 0 0.8rem;
  padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
}
h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 1.6rem 0 0.4rem; }
code {
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  font-size: 0.86em;
  background: var(--soft);
  padding: 0.05rem 0.3rem;
  border-radius: 3px;
  word-break: break-all;
}
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem; }
th, td { text-align: left; vertical-align: top; padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
thead th { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; }
.facts th { width: 12rem; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
.conclusion { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0.2rem 0 1rem; }
.note, .muted { color: var(--muted); }
.banner {
  border: 2px solid var(--accent);
  border-left-width: 8px;
  padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
  margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
  background: #fdf3f2;
}
.counts { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem 1.4rem; padding: 0; margin: 0.4rem 0 0; }
.counts li { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem; }
.counts .num { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--accent); margin-right: 0.25rem; }
.chain { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 0.4rem; margin-top: 1.6rem; }
.rank { margin: 0.2rem 0 0.5rem; }
.badge {
  display: inline-block;
  border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  color: var(--accent);
  padding: 0 0.45rem;
  margin-right: 0.4rem;
  font-size: 0.86rem;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.cid { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.86rem; }
details { border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem; margin: 0.5rem 0; }
summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
.steps { margin: 0.4rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.3rem; }
.steps li { margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
.step-desc { font-weight: 600; }
.step-flow { margin: 0.1rem 0; }
.sink { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
.step-src .snippet {
  display: block;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
}
.warnings { margin: 0.4rem 0 0; }
.counter td { font-size: 0.92rem; }
.methods dt { font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.7rem; }
.methods dd { margin: 0.1rem 0 0 0; }
.limitations li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
@media print {
  body { max-width: none; padding: 0; }
  h2 { break-after: avoid; }
  article.chain, details, section { break-inside: avoid; }
  .banner { border-color: #000; background: #fff; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

{% if not report.protection.analyzable %}
<div class="banner" role="alert">
  <strong>无法分析：检测到强加固（{{ report.protection.labels|join(", ") or "未给出标签" }}）。</strong>
  加固后的代码不在静态解析范围内，下面的空结果<strong>不代表应用没有风险</strong>。
</div>
{% endif %}

<section id="title">
  <h1>ReachScope 分析报告</h1>
  <p class="conclusion">{{ conclusion }}</p>
</section>

<section id="disclaimer">
  <h2>免责声明</h2>
  <p>本报告仅用于<strong>经授权的安全测试</strong>、自有应用审计、教学与研究。ReachScope 只做离线静态分析，不执行目标 APK、不发起网络请求、不生成 PoC。未经授权不得将本报告用于第三方应用。</p>
</section>

<section id="input">
  <h2>输入信息</h2>
  <table class="facts">
    <tbody>
      <tr><th>包名</th><td><code>{{ report.meta.package or "—" }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><th>版本</th><td>{{ report.meta.version_name or "—" }}{% if report.meta.version_code %}（versionCode {{ report.meta.version_code }}）{% endif %}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>APK 路径</th><td><code>{{ report.meta.apk_path or "—" }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><th>SHA-256</th><td><code>{{ report.meta.apk_sha256 or "—" }}</code></td></tr>
      <tr><th>targetSdk / minSdk</th><td>{{ report.meta.target_sdk if report.meta.target_sdk is not none else "未声明" }} / {{ report.meta.min_sdk if report.meta.min_sdk is not none else "未声明" }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>分析时间</th><td>{{ report.meta.analyzed_at or "—" }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>工具版本</th><td>{{ report.meta.tool_version or "—" }}{% if report.meta.apktool_version %}（apktool {{ report.meta.apktool_version }}）{% endif %}</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<section id="protection">
  <h2>保护状态</h2>
  <table class="facts">
    <tbody>
      <tr><th>APKiD 检测</th><td>{% if report.protection.detected is none %}未检测（apkid 不可用）{% elif report.protection.detected %}检测到加固{% else %}未检测到加固{% endif %}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>加固标签</th><td>{{ report.protection.labels|join(", ") or "—" }}</td></tr>
      <tr><th>可否分析</th><td>{{ "是" if report.protection.analyzable else "否（强加固，已短路）" }}</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% if report.meta.warnings %}
  <details>
    <summary>解析告警（{{ report.meta.warnings|length }} 条）</summary>
    <ul class="warnings">
      {% for warning in report.meta.warnings[:50] %}
      <li>{{ warning }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% if report.meta.warnings|length > 50 %}
    <p class="muted">只显示前 50 条，完整列表见 JSON 报告。</p>
    {% endif %}
  </details>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="overview">
  <h2>概览</h2>
  <ul class="counts">
    <li><span class="num">{{ report.summary().components }}</span>组件</li>
    <li><span class="num">{{ report.summary().deeplinks }}</span>深链</li>
    <li><span class="num">{{ report.summary().webviews }}</span>WebView</li>
    <li><span class="num">{{ report.summary().bridges }}</span>JS 桥</li>
    <li><span class="num">{{ report.summary().chains }}</span>链</li>
    <li><span class="num">{{ report.summary().findings }}</span>发现</li>
    <li><span class="num">{{ report.summary().counter_examples }}</span>反例</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="chains">
  <h2>链路</h2>
  {% if report.findings %}
  <p class="note">按（exploitability, impact, confidence）字典序降序排列，同分按 chain id 升序。</p>
  {% for finding in report.findings %}
  {% set chain = chains_by_id.get(finding.chain_id) %}
  <article class="chain">
    <h3>{{ finding.title }}</h3>
    <p class="rank">
      <span class="badge">可利用性 {{ finding.exploitability.value }}</span>
      <span class="badge">影响 {{ finding.impact.value }}</span>
      <span class="badge">置信度 {{ finding.confidence.value }}</span>
      <span class="cid">chain {{ finding.chain_id }}</span>
    </p>
    <p class="summary">{{ finding.summary }}</p>

    {% if chain %}
    <details open>
      <summary>步骤（{{ chain.steps|length }} 步）：{{ chain.steps|map(attribute="description")|join(" → ") }}</summary>
      <ol class="steps">
        {% for step in chain.steps %}
        <li>
          <div class="step-desc">{{ step.order }}. {{ step.description }}</div>
          <div class="step-flow">{% if step.from_ %}<code>{{ step.from_ }}</code>{% endif %}{% if step.to %} → <code>{{ step.to }}</code>{% endif %}{% if step.sink %} <span class="sink">[{{ step.sink }}]</span>{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="step-src">证据：<code>{{ step.source|loc }}</code>{% if step.source and step.source.snippet %}<span class="snippet">{{ step.source.snippet }}</span>{% endif %}</div>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>判据打分（{{ chain.judgments|length }} 条）</summary>
      {% if chain.judgments %}
      <table class="judgments">
        <thead><tr><th>判据</th><th>结论</th><th>置信度</th><th>加减分</th><th>理由</th><th>证据</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for judgment in chain.judgments %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ judgment.name }}</td>
            <td>{{ judgment.result.value }}</td>
            <td>{{ judgment.confidence.value }}</td>
            <td>{{ judgment.score_delta }}</td>
            <td>{{ judgment.reason }}</td>
            <td><code>{{ judgment.source|loc }}</code></td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      {% else %}
      <p class="muted">该链没有记录判据。</p>
      {% endif %}
    </details>
    {% endif %}

    <details>
      <summary>反证（{{ finding.counter_evidence|length }} 条）</summary>
      {% if finding.counter_evidence %}
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>判据</th><th>理由</th><th>证据</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for counter in finding.counter_evidence %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ counter.judgment }}</td>
            <td>{{ counter.reason }}</td>
            <td><code>{{ counter.source|loc }}</code></td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      {% else %}
      <p class="muted">未记录反证。</p>
      {% endif %}
    </details>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
  <p>{% if report.protection.analyzable %}未发现满足纳入条件的链路（J1 PASS、J2 PASS、J6 不为 low 且 exploitability ≥ medium）。{% else %}加固导致分析短路，未产出链路。{% endif %}</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="counter-examples">
  <h2>反例</h2>
  {% if report.counter_examples %}
  <p class="note">按入口排序。反例表示入口存在，但未达到 Finding 的纳入条件。</p>
  <table class="counter">
    <thead><tr><th>入口</th><th>类型</th><th>失败判据</th><th>原因</th><th>证据</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for counter_example in report.counter_examples %}
      <tr>
        <td><code>{{ counter_example.entry_id }}</code></td>
        <td>{{ counter_example.entry_kind.value }}</td>
        <td>{{ counter_example.failed_judgment }}</td>
        <td>{{ counter_example.reason }}</td>
        <td><code>{{ counter_example.source|loc }}</code></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  {% else %}
  <p>未发现入口：没有可被第三方触达的组件，因此没有反例可列。</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<section id="methods">
  <h2>方法说明</h2>
  <dl class="methods">
    {% for name, description in rules %}
    <dt>{{ name }}</dt>
    <dd>{{ description }}</dd>
    {% endfor %}
  </dl>
</section>

<section id="limitations">
  <h2>局限性</h2>
  <ul class="limitations">
    <li><strong>加固与混淆</strong>：整体 DEX 加密的 APK 无法分析（报告置顶警告）；混淆只降低类名可读性，调用关系仍可用于判定。</li>
    <li><strong>反射与动态注册</strong>：调用图会断链，链证据标记为不完整，不进入 Finding。</li>
    <li><strong>异步执行</strong>：Kotlin 协程 / Flow、Handler、回调等异步路径不在 v0.1 的建模范围内，可能漏报。</li>
    <li><strong>跨语言框架</strong>：Flutter / React Native 的业务逻辑不在 smali 层，静态分析覆盖不到。</li>
    <li><strong>污点范围</strong>：深链参数只跟踪到“调用可达”一层，不做跨方法的参数级污点传递。</li>
    <li><strong>多 WebView</strong>：不追踪 <code>addJavascriptInterface</code> 的接收者与具体 WebView 实例的对应关系。</li>
    <li><strong>全量索引</strong>：v0.1 会索引 APK 内全部类（§9.4 的超大 APK 降级路径未实现），内存占用可能超过 1 GB。</li>
    <li><strong>Windows 长路径</strong>：路径超过 260 个字符的 smali 文件读不到，计入解析告警，不做静默跳过。</li>
  </ul>
</section>

</body>
</html>
